  "voiceCalls": [
    {
      "provider": "minimax",
      "model": "speech-2.8-hd",
      "voice": "Chinese (Mandarin)_Warm_Girl",
      "traceId": "071a3bac78398a971155d3acfc27dcda",
      "text": "打开映序，输入一个视频主题，就能从创作入口规划全片。文案、画面与声音汇入清晰流程，初次使用也能轻松开始。",
      "sha256": "e08ca4a7d8784dde176b773e9274fd0dd85f58153d485cb4e358ffb4dcb15de0",
      "at": "2026-10-11T03:55:26.906Z"
    },
    {
      "provider": "minimax",
      "model": "speech-2.8-hd",
      "voice": "Chinese (Mandarin)_Warm_Girl",
      "traceId": "071a3baf2c6cadafa3c776ec1f1d2a13",
      "text": "文案模块可复用本机创作能力，或连接开放兼容的模型服务，把主题整理成多个场景，并生成标题、要点和自然口播。",
      "sha256": "8dfa143b103005e192ab857b1a97b6a5ca7e19d8b87d0c390d50fc4b51d7deb4",
      "at": "2026-10-11T03:55:28.645Z"
    },
    {
      "provider": "minimax",
      "model": "speech-2.8-hd",
      "voice": "Chinese (Mandarin)_Warm_Girl",
      "traceId": "071a3bb1d017a92a06773065bcf3fc31",
      "text": "每个场景都能导入自己的图片，也可通过兼容服务生成画面。聊天内置图片工具需先完成生成，再把成品导入工作台。",
      "sha256": "731f2af564cb0e0ccab68c5fecd139ff56e2ffe3347fa713eed352a753af2f5b",
      "at": "2026-10-11T03:55:30.15Z"
    },
    {
      "provider": "minimax",
      "model": "speech-2.8-hd",
      "voice": "Chinese (Mandarin)_Warm_Girl",
      "traceId": "071a3bb26753e416e72ad79afbf8da2a",
      "text": "配音模块可连接语音服务，为各段口播生成自然中文声音。画面与声音按场景对应，预览时更容易检查节奏和表达。",
      "sha256": "f220a7e6e1cc2bd59933adc8d175484a834012d7680586581116f85b64e7e0f3",
      "at": "2026-10-11T03:55:31.702Z"
    },
    {
      "provider": "minimax",
      "model": "speech-2.8-hd",
      "voice": "Chinese (Mandarin)_Warm_Girl",
      "traceId": "071a3bfff1a919b146d289cabbbc8d1d",
      "text": "生成之后仍由你掌控。可以修改标题、要点和口播，用前移、后移调整场景顺序。某段不满意，只需重新生成这一段的图片或配音。",
      "sha256": "8a85fdfc7b60474e941e4fe810fd5e060cebc54ecc3094b17687b5cc78daebf2",
      "at": "2026-10-11T03:56:48.698Z"
    },
    {
      "provider": "minimax",
      "model": "speech-2.8-hd",
      "voice": "Chinese (Mandarin)_Warm_Girl",
      "traceId": "071a3c01e9d5eda7a1bae5077659520b",
      "text": "确认所有分镜后，映序会在本机合成画面与配音，导出高清的视频文件。你可以直接播放和下载，也可以保留不同版本，比较修改前后的效果。",
      "sha256": "0eb65c8ee78c58bf9772e9ae802a173cb4aab902f28930426803d16f12316ef8",
      "at": "2026-10-11T03:56:50.393Z"
    }
  ],
